<title>UK: IKB sets 100 mln mark step-up four-year bond.</title>
<headline>IKB sets 100 mln mark step-up four-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager WGZ Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   IKB DEUTSCHE INDUSTRIEBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON     *4.0	MATURITY    08.FEB.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  102.0     PAY DATE   L07.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.10	LISTING    DUESS     L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.10	SELL CONC  2.0	 DENOMS (K)  10</p>
<p> NOTES	*FOR YEAR ONE, 4.25 PCT FOR YEAR TWO, 4.50 PCT YEAR</p>
<p>		 THREE AND 5.0 PCT TO MATURITY</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
